cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this repository or its results, please cite both the repository and
  the note it supports.
title: >-
  Confined accelerated-Collatz words — companion computations
abstract: >-
  Exact-arithmetic computations, pre-registrations and reports supporting the
  confined accelerated-Collatz word studies: the reduction of the checkpoint
  decision tree to a staircase-constrained lattice-path count, slope-independence
  of the global shape of the weighted profile, and two closed proof routes for the
  uniqueness of its maximum. Every confinement, prune, return and tie decision is
  an exact integer comparison.
